# SS-16 - Investigate Groww, Paytm Money, m.Stock and Samco
Workstream ID: SS-16
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/16
Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M4
Dependencies: SS-03

## Purpose
Evaluate newer/alternative retail APIs without accepting marketing history claims as qualification.

## Tasks
- [ ] Groww: active subscription requirement, historical depth, feed permissions and NSE/BSE.
- [ ] Paytm Money: actual developer docs beyond portal shell, history, fees and auth.
- [ ] m.Stock: versioned history/data docs, advertised free plan, account needs and quotas.
- [ ] Samco: advertised adjusted 30-year history, per-instrument coverage and retention rights.
- [ ] Complete common qualification and separate go/no-go for each candidate.

## Acceptance criteria
- Price/history claims are labelled provider-authored and rechecked before integration.
- No accounts, paid plans or broker orders are activated by research work.

## Completion evidence
- Groww SDK and m.Stock/Samco official product pages read; Paytm portal shell discovered.
- Actual data qualification not started.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Registered four explicit provider investigation tasks.
